{
  "id": "ECC.10",
  "number": "10",
  "bookId": "ECC",
  "reference": "Ecclesiastes 10",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "10",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "10",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dead flies cause the ointment of the apothecary to send forth a stinking savour:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "so doth",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a little folly him that is in reputation for wisdom",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "honour.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A wise man's heart",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "at his right hand; but a fool's heart at his left.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea also, when he that is a fool walketh by the way, his wisdom faileth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", and he saith to every one",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a fool.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the spirit of the ruler rise up against thee, leave not thy place; for yielding pacifieth great offences.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There is an evil",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have seen under the sun, as an error",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "proceedeth from the ruler:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Folly is set in great dignity, and the rich sit in low place.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have seen servants upon horses, and princes walking as servants upon the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He that diggeth a pit shall fall into it; and whoso breaketh an hedge, a serpent shall bite him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoso removeth stones shall be hurt therewith;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he that cleaveth wood shall be endangered thereby.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If the iron be blunt, and he do not whet the edge, then must he put to more strength: but wisdom",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "profitable to direct.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Surely the serpent will bite without enchantment; and a babbler is no better.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The words of a wise man's mouth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gracious; but the lips of a fool will swallow up himself.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The beginning of the words of his mouth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "foolishness: and the end of his talk",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mischievous madness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A fool also is full of words: a man cannot tell what shall be; and what shall be after him, who can tell him?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The labour of the foolish wearieth every one of them, because he knoweth not how to go to the city.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Woe to thee, O land, when thy king",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a child, and thy princes eat in the morning!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Blessed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou, O land, when thy king",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.10.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.10.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the son of nobles, and thy princes eat in due season, for strength, and not for drunkenness!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ By much slothfulness the building decayeth; and through idleness of the hands the house droppeth through.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.10.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ A feast is made for laughter, and wine maketh merry: but money answereth all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.10.19",
